acking (Cookie)] in [Edit] menu.\n2. Click  [Manual Request Editor...] in [Tools] menu.\n    At this point, [Use current tracking session] toggle button is still off.\n3. Close Manual Request Editor.\n4. Open Manual Request Editor.\n    At this point, [Use current tracking session] toggle button is on.\n5. Close Manual Request Editor and uncheck [Enable Session Tracking (Cookie)] in [Edit]\nmenu.\n6. Open Manual Request Editor.\n    At this point, [Use current tracking session] toggle button is still on.\n7. Reopen Manual Request Editor.\n    At this point, [Use current tracking session] toggle button is still on. \n\nWhat is the expected output? What do you see instead?\n- At the point of step 2, [Use current tracking session] toggle button should be on.\n- At the point of step 6 and 7, [Use current tracking session] toggle button should\nbe off.\n\nWhat version of the product are you using? On what operating system?\n\nZAP2.3.0.1\nMac OS X 10.9.2 \n\nPlease provide any additional information below.\n\n- In the branches/2.3/src/org/parosproxy/paros/extension/state/ExtensionState.java#105,\n  it might be good to call \"isSelected\" method instead of \"isEnabled\".\n- In the branches/2.3/src/org/parosproxy/paros/extension/manualrequest/ManualRequestEditorDialog.java#99,\n  \"getMessageSender().cleanup()\" is called in \"windowClosing\" method, but it might\nbe good to call \"getMessageSender().cleanup()\" at the point of window opening to reload\nthe current toggle's status before doing Manual Request task.\n\n```\n\nOriginal issue reported on code.google.com by `yukisov` on 2014-04-23 14:09:11\n","closed_by":{"login":"psiinon","id":1081115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODExMTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1081115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/psiinon","html_url":"https://github.com/psiinon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psiinon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psiinon/following{/